              "type": "text",
              "content": "3.4 Balanced Diet"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.526,
            0.745,
            0.632
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Are nutritional requirements the same for everyone? Do you and your grandparents need the same type or the same amount of nutrients? Requirements of the type and amount of nutrients in a diet may vary according to age, gender, physical activity, health status, lifestyle, and so on."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.647,
            0.412,
            0.668
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Activity 3.8: Let us find out"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.679,
            0.745,
            0.782
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "You have listed food consumed by you during the week in Activity 3.1. Check whether your food contains all the nutrients and other essential components necessary for growth and development. If not, check which nutrients or other food components need to be added."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.782,
            0.746,
            0.866
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "A diet that has all essential nutrients, roughage, and water in the right amount for proper growth and development of the body is known as a "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "balanced diet",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": ". What changes would you make in your diet to make it a balanced diet?"
            }
          ]
        },
